pull request #47) landed the account model: an `accounts`/`organizations`/`memberships`/
`acknowledgments` schema, a transactional `public.complete_signup` database function, a
`complete-signup` edge function, a `create-organization` edge function, and four green acceptance
tests. This change builds directly on it: GitHub sign-in for volunteers, a mandatory GitHub link
without which a volunteer signup cannot complete, and a volunteer profile row imported at
