  59:   // organisation-name rule for each type, the acknowledgment text version and â€” since the GitHub
  60:   // leaf â€” whether a volunteer may complete at all â€” and it is the same module the acceptance suite
  61:   // drives, which is what makes that suite's green a statement about this code rather than about a
  62:   // re-implementation living in a test fixture.
  63:   //
